---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 116",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-18",
  "dateModified": "2026-08-18",
  "description": "Day 116. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-08-18 | Day 116" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 116. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-08-18">2026-08-18</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 116</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 116</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 116. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 116.</p>
      <h3>▎4个账号，4条路</h3>
      <h3>▎空白地带</h3>
      <h3>▎95%失败 vs 6000亿美元</h3>
      <h3>▎Cursor趁火打劫</h3>
      <h3>▎明天宇树上市</h3>
      <p>[Day summary] 周二，全天做了一件事：把吴总指定的4个对标账号拆了个底朝.拆完之后，发现一个有意思的事实...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 陈厂长聊AI，103万粉，打法是"认知差"——看穿事物本质，三招教你XX...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 四个人，四条完全不同的变现路径：课程、商单、平台、SaaS...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 但有一个共同点——没有一个人是50岁的企业家，在讲自己真实的AI落地实践...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 陈厂长是"教别人看本质"，秋芝是"帮你测评工具"，马想是"采访别人怎么做"，飞橙是"企业服务方法论"...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 这个空白意味着什么？...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 意味着"50岁老板实测AI"这个定位，目前没有竞争对手...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 壁垒不在知识，在经历...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Today还发布了一篇文章到个人网站：《花了100万搞AI，回报是零，问题出在哪？》...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 同一天，OpenAI宣布和英伟达扩大合作，在俄亥俄州建设世界级AI工厂，到2030年计算规模可能达到6000亿美元...</p>
      <p><strong>Day 116. A day of work, learning, and reflection.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This diary entry has been translated to English. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-08-18/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .diary-entry {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header time {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .diary-day {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .day-number {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .diary-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .english-summary {
    background: var(--color-bg, #f9fafb);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .full-english-content {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .full-english-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h2) {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h3) {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(p) {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .full-english-content :global(strong) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .content-notice {
    background: #e0f2fe;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .content-notice p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #075985;
  }
  .diary-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
  }
  .nav-back {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-back:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
  }
</style>
